<tr class="medhigh"><td>56</td><td>High</td><td>Prof. Nikolaus Rajewsky / BIMSB RNA community</td><td>Berlin Institute for Medical Systems Biology</td><td>Berlin</td><td>RNA systems biology</td><td>Major German hub for RNA, single-cell, and regulatory genomics.</td><td>Target specific calls where wet-lab plus omics is valued.</td><td>https://www.mdc-berlin.de/bimsb</td></tr>
